# Store text files with LF in the repository regardless of core.autocrlf.
# History here was written under core.autocrlf=true (LF blobs), but generators
# run on Windows emit CRLF. Without this rule a regenerated doc lands in the
# repo with CRLF while the rest of the tree is LF, producing whole-file diffs
# whose real content delta is a line or two.
* text=auto
